; Stage 2b: 6 pixel font from the option file (a synthetic GADGETUP does
; not toggle the font gadget - Intuition sets GFLG_SELECTED, not the message):
; L/blitzeditor.opts with fonthite 6; start, BOTTOM.  Nothing saved.
; Fails in every combination on a 512 row Workbench: calcscreen makes the
; font 6 screen 513 rows, OpenWindow fails, screenopen's error path crashes
; (BUG(orig) (#351), programs/ted/src/screen.c calcscreen).
; @known KNOWN-BOTH (28.10.2026): 513 row screen on a 512 row Workbench
; @source T t01_int
; @opts fonthite=6,fonthite2=5,fontmul=960
; @font 6
; @expect same t01_int.bb2
; @expect absent t01_int.bb2.bak
; @expect opts blitzeditor.opts fonthite=6,fonthite2=5,fontmul=960
; @est 4
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
dump start
menu 2 1
dump bottom
menu 0 9
wait exit
